# Funded profiles need an HTTPS Polygon RPC with finalized/historical reads,
# owner-approved CTF operator/pUSD exchange allowance, and supported account transport.
# DepositWallet/type3 requires the owner's privately configured Relayer API key
# and its controlling EOA address; closeout gas is sponsored by that transport.
# Direct EOA/proxy/Safe closeout requires signer POL for gas.
# Account identity/signature type is configured in the public TOML profile.
